<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in very heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average lost 79.01 to 6,442.69.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 3.29 to 394.85.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell 35 cents.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1,294 to 1,192.</p>
<p>Volume was 515,647,480, compared with 412,499,170 Monday.</p>
